+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; script-src-attr 'none'; style-src 'self'; style-src-attr 'none'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-src 'none'; worker-src 'none'; manifest-src 'none'; require-trusted-types-for 'script'; trusted-types 'none'">
+  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+
+<body>
+
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container policy">
+    <h1>Privacy at The Daily Grind</h1>
+    <p>This notice describes this static website. It does not describe an account, rewards, ordering, or payment service.</p>
+    <h2>Browse without being tracked</h2>
+    <p>These pages do not run JavaScript, use analytics, advertising pixels, fingerprinting, cookies, or browser storage. We do not collect information through forms. Images, styles, and fonts are served locally or supplied by your device, so viewing a page does not contact an image provider, font service, or social network.</p>
+    <h2>What happens when you visit</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends the hosting provider information needed to deliver the page, including your IP address, the requested address, and browser request headers. The provider may retain access or security logs under its own configuration. This website does not set that retention period. Avoid putting personal information or secrets in page addresses.</p>
+    <h2>Your choices</h2>
+    <p>You can use these pages with JavaScript disabled. There are no optional trackers to accept or reject and no site-created profile or stored browser data to delete.</p>
+    <h2>Other services</h2>
+    <p>Menu, account, rewards, ordering, and contact links may lead to services outside these static pages. Review the privacy notice of any service before sharing personal or payment information.</p>
+    <p><a href="/">Return to The Daily Grind</a></p>
+  </main>
+  <footer>
+    <p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co. All rights reserved.</p>
+  </footer>
+</body>
+</html>
